        "original_id": "78f5c1b6-8a4f-5c51-b750-be7df29330e9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Faulkner, Richard Grossman, Mark Kingsmill, Brad Shepherd, Pierre Charles Bouvier\n- Bands: Hoodoo Gurus, Simple Plan\n- Places: Sydney, Australia, Canada\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, guitarist, bassist, drummer, harmonica player, composer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Hoodoo Gurus are an Australian rock band formed in Sydney in 1981.\n- Dave Faulkner formed Hoodoo Gurus in 1981 and served as the band’s songwriter, lead singer, and guitarist.\n- Richard Grossman later joined Hoodoo Gurus as bassist.\n- Mark Kingsmill later joined Hoodoo Gurus as drummer.\n- Brad Shepherd later joined Hoodoo Gurus as guitarist, vocalist, and harmonica player.\n- Fans refer to Hoodoo Gurus as the Gurus.\n- Pierre Charles Bouvier was born on 9 May 1979.\n- Pierre Charles Bouvier is a Canadian singer, songwriter, musician, composer, and actor.\n- Pierre Charles Bouvier is best known as the lead singer and guitarist of the rock band Simple Plan.",
